{"4080080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "UNHOST", "steam_appid": 4080080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080080/extras/2b8406bcdd1ab305b4db4cf5c6f7af36.webp?t=1777191013\" width=1170 height=25 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080080/extras/b61d7403f1653d4e509660149d1a9a5f.webp?t=1777191013\" alt=\"Survive Seven Nights\" width=1170 height=57 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080080/extras/38c9c99cdc68f51803be1e28ec7aae25.webp?t=1777191013\" width=7 height=12 /></span> UNHOST is a <strong>psychological horror puzzle</strong> where you play as a paranormal detective. For seven nights, an abandoned hospital becomes your workplace. Investigate the mysterious disappearances of those who lost their lives within these walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080080/extras/15deb3944df9a81af3b2da3f905bb2b9.poster.avif?t=1777191013\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080080/extras/15deb3944df9a81af3b2da3f905bb2b9.webm?t=1777191013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080080/extras/15deb3944df9a81af3b2da3f905bb2b9.mp4?t=1777191013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080080/extras/868610d0a311d829201a93b07ab797ad.webp?t=1777191013\" alt=\"Observe Anomalies\" width=1170 height=57 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080080/extras/38c9c99cdc68f51803be1e28ec7aae25.webp?t=1777191013\" width=7 height=12 /></span> During each night shift, you <strong>monitor</strong> the building through a surveillance camera system. Your task is to <strong>detect anomalies</strong> in time: distorted lighting, strange sounds, moving or disappearing objects, and other deviations that are easy to miss. Capture them with a <strong>remote-controlled robot</strong> before ghosts can reach you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080080/extras/9db4676b59e0a49206ccfc0c579dd28f.poster.avif?t=1777191013\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080080/extras/9db4676b59e0a49206ccfc0c579dd28f.webm?t=1777191013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080080/extras/9db4676b59e0a49206ccfc0c579dd28f.mp4?t=1777191013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080080/extras/1f9408ea4d130b8375ea65412bd81354.webp?t=1777191013\" alt=\"Uncover the Truth \" width=1170 height=57 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080080/extras/38c9c99cdc68f51803be1e28ec7aae25.webp?t=1777191013\" width=7 height=12 /></span> By day, you analyze collected <strong>evidence</strong> and images, listen to audio recordings, and move forward in the investigation. Using a custom-built device, you can <strong>make contact with the ghosts</strong> haunting the hospital. Each of them has its own story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080080/extras/06b6df1d174ac57e2f090b226e36755f.poster.avif?t=1777191013\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080080/extras/06b6df1d174ac57e2f090b226e36755f.webm?t=1777191013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080080/extras/06b6df1d174ac57e2f090b226e36755f.mp4?t=1777191013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080080/extras/aa81fef7ee3611f9b00e95cb11622215.webp?t=1777191013\" alt=\"Fall into Restless Dreams\" width=1170 height=57 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080080/extras/38c9c99cdc68f51803be1e28ec7aae25.webp?t=1777191013\" width=7 height=12 /></span> Your dreams are no longer a respite between shifts. In them, you <strong>explore</strong> unfamiliar places, solve puzzles and uncover fragments of the past. You begin to realize that by immersing yourself in the tragedies of others, you are slowly approaching your own. <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.stea